{"id": "05", "model": "eleven_v4", "lines": [{"speaker": "NARRATOR", "text": "The next day, you take the laptop to school."}, {"speaker": "BRICK", "text": "[slow, smug] Move, noob. Lunch money."}, {"speaker": "YOU", "text": "[smirks, typing] Jail... Brick."}, {"speaker": "BRICK", "text": "[confused] Hey! Who put a CAGE on me?!"}, {"speaker": "NARRATOR", "text": "[proud] For the first time ever, Brick was the one who couldn't move."}, {"speaker": "YOU", "text": "Teleport me... to the front of the line."}, {"speaker": "NARRATOR", "text": "Gym class. The mile run."}, {"speaker": "YOU", "text": "[whispers] Speed me."}, {"speaker": "NARRATOR", "text": "You ran the mile in zero point three seconds. [pause] Your shoes did not survive."}, {"speaker": "COACH", "text": "[stunned] That's... a new world record. [pause] Also... where are your shoes?"}, {"speaker": "NARRATOR", "text": "Math test. You didn't study."}, {"speaker": "YOU", "text": "[typing] Noclip... me."}, {"speaker": "NARRATOR", "text": "Noclip lets you walk through walls. [pause] It does NOT let you choose which wall."}, {"speaker": "PRINCIPAL", "text": "[slow, unimpressed] Young man. [pause] Did you just walk through my wall?"}, {"speaker": "YOU", "text": "[nervous] ...No? [pause] Noclip... me... AWAY!"}, {"speaker": "NARRATOR", "text": "By lunch... you were the most popular kid in school."}, {"speaker": "NARRATOR", "text": "Everybody wanted a command. And you said yes. To everybody."}, {"speaker": "KID", "text": "[excited] Make me fly! [pause] No, wait, make me GIANT! [pause] No, wait, BOTH!"}, {"speaker": "ZOE", "text": "[worried] Stop. Please. The logs. Somebody is going to notice."}, {"speaker": "YOU", "text": "[laughs] Zoe. Relax. Nobody reads the logs."}, {"speaker": "NARRATOR", "text": "[whispers] Somebody... reads the logs."}], "voice_segments": [{"voice_id": "JBFqnCBsd6RMkjVDRZzb", "start_time_seconds": 0.0, "end_time_seconds": 2.64, "character_start_index": 0, "character_end_index": 44, "dialogue_input_